UID:44cf4b3a5f3bc426f08f@global-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Sky & Nature (UK)
DESCRIPTION:Full Hunter's Moon: bright autumn nights once used for hunting
  ahead of winter. Peak at 04:11 UK time\; catch it rising at dusk on the e
 vening closest to the peak for the classic giant-on-the-horizon photo.\n\n
 Status: ✅ Confirmed\nExact full moon: Mon 26 Oct 2026 04:11 GMT. Earth
 –Moon distance 368\,874 km.
LOCATION:Visible across the UK
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
