BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🌌 Starling murmurations (est.)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
UID:0807b96dd839f3871b00@global-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Sky & Nature (UK)
DESCRIPTION:Up to a million starlings swirling in hypnotic shape-shifting 
 clouds at dusk\, then all diving into the reeds at once. Ham Wall on the S
 omerset Levels is under an hour from Bristol.\n\nStatus: 🟡 Estimated (p
 attern-based or provisional\; check before booking)\nBest November–Febru
 ary at dusk\; the Starling Hotline tells you where they're roosting.\nOffi
 cial info: https://www.rspb.org.uk/days-out/reserves/ham-wall
