DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
UID:9b102af08e435cfba63c@global-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Sky & Nature (UK)
DESCRIPTION:The king of showers: slow\, bright\, colourful\, and visible f
 rom mid-evening. Wrap up warm\; it's worth it. Up to ~150/hr under perfect
  skies (realistically a fraction of that). 🌓 Moon 29% lit: decent\, obs
 erve while it's below the horizon.\n\nStatus: 🟡 Estimated (pattern-base
 d or provisional\; check before booking)\nPeak night shown\; the night eit
 her side is usually worthwhile too.\nOfficial info: https://www.imo.net/re
 sources/calendar/
LOCATION:Visible across the UK
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.imo.net/resources/calendar/
