DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270212
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
UID:cb9c463491c99a00f064@global-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Sky & Nature (UK)
DESCRIPTION:Jupiter at its biggest and brightest\, up all night. Binocular
 s show the four Galilean moons lined up.\n\nStatus: ✅ Confirmed\nOpposit
 ion: the planet is opposite the Sun\, so it's visible all night and at its
  brightest. Good for a couple of weeks either side.
LOCATION:Visible across the UK
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
