 rds geomagnetic storms (the Russell–McPherron effect)\, so it's a good f
 ortnight for aurora alerts. Also Nowruz\, Persian New Year.\n\nStatus: ✅
  Confirmed\nExact moment: Sat 20 Mar 2027 20:24 GMT.
LOCATION:Visible across the UK
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
