BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🌌 Lyrids meteor shower peak (est.)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270422
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270423
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
UID:754cdc8117a7a3991758@global-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Sky & Nature (UK)
DESCRIPTION:One of the oldest recorded showers (Chinese records from 687 B
 C). Modest rates\, occasional bright fireballs\, best before dawn. Up to ~
 18/hr under perfect skies (realistically a fraction of that). 🌕 Moon 95
 % lit: the moonlight will drown the fainter meteors\; look for fireballs.
 \n\nStatus: 🟡 Estimated (pattern-based or provisional\; check before bo
 oking)\nPeak night shown\; the night either side is usually worthwhile too
 .\nOfficial info: https://www.imo.net/resources/calendar/
LOCATION:Visible across the UK
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.imo.net/resources/calendar/
END:VEVENT
