BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:✈️ 🌌 Puffin season (Skomer & Farne Islands) (est.)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270516
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
UID:4d102db96efe6bc9d61a@global-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Sky & Nature (UK)
DESCRIPTION:Around 40\,000 puffins on Skomer\, so close you have to give w
 ay to them on the path. Boats from Martin's Haven fill fast\, so book ahea
 d. Season runs mid-May to late July.\n\nStatus: 🟡 Estimated (pattern-ba
 sed or provisional\; check before booking)\n✈️ Trip-worthy: there's a 
