BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:✈️ 🌌 Total solar eclipse: SPAIN · MOROCCO · EGYPT (partia
 l ~35% from UK)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270802
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270803
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
UID:d11f150ddff872ab4e51@global-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Sky & Nature (UK)
DESCRIPTION:The eclipse of the decade. Totality reaches about 6 m 23 s nea
 r Luxor\, one of the longest totalities over land this century. The path o
 f darkness crosses southern Spain and the Strait of Gibraltar\, so Tarifa 
 or Cádiz is a cheap flight away. You get midday darkness\, stars\, the co
 rona and a 360° sunset. From the UK it's only a ~35% partial (around 09:0
 0–11:00 BST). Go to the path. Do not miss this.\n\nStatus: ✅ Confirmed
 \nRule exception\, approved by you: not fully visible from the UK\, but it
 's a ✈️ priority. Book accommodation in the path EARLY\, because it wi
 ll sell out. Proper ISO 12312-2 eclipse glasses are essential for the part
 ial phases.\n✈️ Trip-worthy: there's a booking nudge in the 📅 Booki
 ng Nudges feed ~3 months ahead.\nOfficial info: https://www.timeanddate.co
 m/eclipse/solar/2027-august-2
GEO:36.0143;-5.6044
LOCATION:Totality path: Cádiz/Tarifa\, Gibraltar\, northern Morocco\, Tun
 isia\, Libya\, Luxor (Egypt)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.timeanddate.com/eclipse/solar/2027-august-2
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE="Totality
  path: Cádiz/Tarifa, Gibraltar, northern Morocco, Tunisia, Libya, Luxor (
 Egypt)":geo:36.0143,-5.6044
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Booking nudge: Total solar eclipse: SPAIN · MOROCCO · EGYPT 
 (partial ~35% from UK) is ~3 months away
TRIGGER:-P90D
